//      The `>` is parser-valid as a prefix but the only continuation is `!` (never
//      completing), so EOS is eventually selected. Fix: on EOS inside a span, call
//      RollbackConstrainedToComplete (free) before breaking so the final cleanup
//      finds a clean complete state to close via CloseConstrainedSpan or
//      CloseSpanWithinBudget.
//   3. Kept from attempt 2 (best): penalty 4.0 (reducing to 2.0 hurt accuracy),
